[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":94},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:8":3},{"posts":4,"total":85,"tags":86,"tag":-1},[5,14,22,31,39,48,56,65,73,80],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"【大神來六角】九月直播主題：程式編輯器","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-08-22-god-and-hexschoo","2019\u002F08\u002F22","2019-08-22","正所謂工欲善其事，必先利其器，雖然您懂得許多前端語法，但如果沒有好的工具輔助，效率自然無法再往上提升。本月主題將分享各種 Edit 編輯器上的套件與設定介紹。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F08%2F%E5%A4%A7%E7%A5%9E-topic-sep.png?alt=media&token=2554a323-b3cd-41b1-a7fc-52970e5fd744",[13],"event",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"2019 IT 鐵人邦有獎徵文活動","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-08-20-ithelp-2020ironman","2019\u002F08\u002F20","2019-08-20","學歷輸別人，經歷也完敗，如何履歷海中殺出一條血路？工作一段時間，但總是覺得成長幅度有限？那就來寫技術文，提升個人品牌辨識度，讓自己再升級！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F08%2Fithelp-2020Ironman.png?alt=media&token=4fd488a7-6a99-48dd-a6b8-7f950e7475a7",[13],{"title":23,"link":24,"date":25,"dateTime":26,"description":27,"thumbnail":28,"tags":29},"興趣就是即便精力耗盡，還是要做！- 世恩","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-08-15-interview","2019\u002F08\u002F15","2019-08-15","世恩分享，畢業於古蹟藝術修護學系，也清楚科系未來的出路，但覺得人生就是該多方嘗試，踏入社會後積極嘗試不同領域的工作，想找尋自己真正想要做的事情！最後投入資訊領域，成為一名前端工程師","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F08%2Fblog-cover-%E4%B8%96%E6%81%A9.png?alt=media&token=11424380-d217-43e1-be2b-135d4533ae8f",[30],"interview",{"title":32,"link":33,"date":34,"dateTime":35,"description":36,"thumbnail":37,"tags":38},"我們還有很長一段路要走，不要怕！有六角的夥伴們陪你 - Yukon","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-08-08-interview","2019\u002F08\u002F08","2019-08-08","Yukon 媒體設計學系出身，系所希望學生可以盡量多元發展，不偏重某一類學程，Yukon 誤打誤撞地接觸遊戲、動畫、平面、網頁各種媒體設計的相關技術，C 語言及 C++ 意外地學得很順利，但當時一心想走平面設計，沒有發現當時的課程為自己打下了基礎。現在在一家博弈遊戲公司就職，目標希望自己可以經由前端的基礎往後端前進，成為全端工程師！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F08%2Fblog-cover-yukon.png?alt=media&token=1f0a49f5-9d65-4580-bfa8-cb655c5963a7",[30],{"title":40,"link":41,"date":42,"dateTime":43,"description":44,"thumbnail":45,"tags":46},"【學員專屬徵才 - 第二波遠端助教】無工作經驗者優先錄取","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-08-01-remote-jobs-second","2019\u002F08\u002F01","2019-08-01","六角學院 是一所線上程式開發學習單位，目前已累積超過 15,000 名學員，**讓更多人藉由線上學習在職涯規劃上有更多的選擇**是我們的使命是，如果您贊同我們的理念，歡迎加入六角。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F06%2Fhex-hire-TA-fb-2nd.png?alt=media&token=3f129f0c-0476-4195-b665-86b0be05b480",[47],"jobs",{"title":49,"link":50,"date":51,"dateTime":52,"description":53,"thumbnail":54,"tags":55},"【大神來六角】七月直播主題：資料庫","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-06-21-god-and-hexschool","2019\u002F06\u002F21","2019-06-21","你有想過一個大型購物網站，裡面的會員、產品、訂單資訊都被存放到哪裡了呢？你可能大概知道資訊都被存放在資料庫，但資料庫種類五花八門，多到讓您眼花撩亂，到底該如何有系統性地了解資料庫呢？","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F06%2F%E5%A4%A7%E7%A5%9E-topic-july.png?alt=media&token=26730eec-f598-4d92-92c0-7aa6c2669721",[13],{"title":57,"link":58,"date":59,"dateTime":60,"description":61,"thumbnail":62,"tags":63},"The F2E - 第二屆 前端 & UI 修練精神時光屋","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-06-14-the_f2e","2019\u002F06\u002F14","2019-06-14","你想變強嗎？你想獲得力量嗎？你想透過前端改變你的生活，但找不到地方修練嗎？如果你的答案是「Yes」那麼你來對地方了！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F06%2FF2E-2nd-1200x628.png?alt=media&token=3e297d87-8c3a-492a-8759-89af4ecd4c90",[64],"skilltree",{"title":66,"link":67,"date":68,"dateTime":69,"description":70,"thumbnail":71,"tags":72},"【大神來六角】六月直播主題：檔案傳輸","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-05-22-god-and-hexschool","2019\u002F05\u002F22","2019-05-22","身為軟體工程師，最常打交道就是「檔案」，舉凡是圖片、壓縮檔、office 文件都是能透過網際網路進行傳輸，其代表性的雲服務為 AWS S3 、Google Cloud Storage、Firebase Storage，本月直播的主題將會對檔案進行深入探討。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F05%2F%E5%A4%A7%E7%A5%9E-topic-june.png?alt=media&token=f7b42442-6f42-4e10-920c-4896fe2fb455",[13],{"title":74,"link":75,"date":76,"dateTime":77,"description":44,"thumbnail":78,"tags":79},"【徵人】【高雄】實習生 1~3 名","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-05-13-internship","2019\u002F05\u002F13","2019-05-13","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F05%2Fhex-hire-intern-fb.png?alt=media&token=dffc89f2-dc10-4e2f-ba74-e4c45697f692",[47],{"title":81,"link":82,"date":76,"dateTime":77,"description":44,"thumbnail":83,"tags":84},"【學員專屬徵才 - 遠端助教】無程式工作經驗者優先錄取","\u002Fblog\u002F2019-05-13-remote-jobs","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2019%2F05%2Fhex-hire-TA-fb.png?alt=media&token=de1fb813-9419-4620-bdee-67cae3c686a9",[47],122,[87,88,89,90,91,13,30,92,47,64,93],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","javascript","software engineer",1791348123893]